  "summary": {
    "problem": "The arrowhead picker popup could overflow off the edge of the screen, especially near the right or bottom viewport edges, because its inner wrapper had position:absolute styling and Radix's collision avoidance could not see the wrapper as the popup surface.",
    "solution": "Move all styling props (class, role, aria attributes) directly onto the Radix Popover.Content element and remove position:absolute from the inner wrapper, so Radix measures and repositions the real popup boundary and the picker never escapes the editor container."
  },
