    "title": "Arrowhead picker stays inside the screen",
    "problem": "The arrowhead picker could slide off the edge of the screen because the built-in collision-avoidance system didn't know where the visible edge of the popup was.",
    "fix": "The popup surface is now the single element that Radix measures, so it correctly nudges the picker back into view whenever it would overflow."
  },
